#. i18n: file: rip/videodvd/base_k3bvideodvdrippingwidget.ui:485
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_checkTwoPassEncoding)
#: rc.cpp:212
msgid "&2-pass encoding"
msgstr "Koderen in &2 Schreed"

#. i18n: file: rip/videodvd/base_k3bvideodvdrippingwidget.ui:488
#. i18n: ectx: property (shortcut), widget (QCheckBox, m_checkTwoPassEncoding)
#: rc.cpp:215
msgid "Alt+2"
msgstr "Alt+2"

#. i18n: file: rip/videodvd/base_k3bvideodvdrippingwidget.ui:494
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, m_checkTwoPassEncoding)
#: rc.cpp:218
msgid "Enable 2-pass encoding"
msgstr "Koderen in 2 Schreed anmaken"

#. i18n: file: rip/videodvd/base_k3bvideodvdrippingwidget.ui:499
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_checkTwoPassEncoding)
#: rc.cpp:221
msgid ""
"<p>If this option is checked K3b encodes the video titles in two passes. The "
"first pass is used to gather information about the video in order to improve "
"the distribution of bits in the second pass. The resulting video will have a "
"higher quality using a variable bitrate.\n"
"<p>If this option is not checked K3b will create video files with a constant "
"bitrate and a lower quality.\n"
"<p>2-pass encoding results in a doubled encoding time."
msgstr ""
"<p>Is dit anmaakt, kodeert K3b de Video-Titeln in twee Schreed. Wielt den "
"eersten Dörloop warrt Informatschonen över dat Video sammelt, mit de de "
"Verdelen vun de Bits in den tweten Dörloop verbetert warrt. Dat rutkamen "
"Video hett denn en höger Gööd mit en variabel Bitrate.\n"
"<p>Is dat nich anmaakt, suert dor Videodateien mit en fast Bitrate un sieter "
"Gööd bi rut.\n"
"<p>Dat Koderen in twee Schreed duert dubbelt so lang."

#. i18n: file: rip/videodvd/base_k3bvideodvdrippingwidget.ui:506
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_checkAutoClipping)
#: rc.cpp:226
msgid "Automatic &Video Clipping"
msgstr "Video automaatsch &tosnieden"

#. i18n: file: rip/videodvd/base_k3bvideodvdrippingwidget.ui:512
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, m_checkAutoClipping)
#: rc.cpp:229
msgid "Automatically detect the black borders of the video"
msgstr "Automaatsch de swatten Randbalkens vun dat Video finnen"

#. i18n: file: rip/videodvd/base_k3bvideodvdrippingwidget.ui:517
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_checkAutoClipping)
#: rc.cpp:232
msgid ""
"<p>Most Video DVDs are encoded in a letterboxed format. <em>Letterboxed</em> "
"refers to black bars used at the top and bottom (and sometimes at the sides) "
"of the video to force it into one of the aspect ratios supported by the "
"Video DVD standard.\n"
"<p>If this option is checked K3b will automatically detect and remove these "
"black bars from the resulting video.\n"
"<p>Although this method is very reliable there may be problems if the source "
"material is exceptionally short or dark."
msgstr ""
"<p>De mehrsten Video-DVDs sünd mit swatte Balkens baven un nerrn kodeert, "
"mennigmaal findt sik de ok an de Sieden. Dit warrt ok \"<em>letterboxing</em>"
"\" nöömt. Nödig is dat, wiel sik dat Video anners nich in een vun de "
"Standardformaten för Video-DVDs rinpramsen lett.\n"
"<p>Is dit anmaakt, findt K3b disse Ränners automaatsch un maakt se ut dat "
"Resultaat weg.\n"
"<p>Op disse Metood is normalerwies redig Verlaat, man dat kann to Problemen "
"kamen, wenn dat Bornvideo bannig kort oder düüster is."

#. i18n: file: rip/videodvd/base_k3bvideodvdrippingwidget.ui:524
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_checkAudioResampling)
#: rc.cpp:237
msgid "Resample Audio to &44.1 KHz"
msgstr "Audio-Aftastrate to &44.1 kHz ümwanneln"

#. i18n: file: rip/videodvd/base_k3bvideodvdrippingwidget.ui:527
#. i18n: ectx: property (shortcut), widget (QCheckBox, m_checkAudioResampling)
#: rc.cpp:240
msgid "Alt+4"
msgstr "Alt+4"

#. i18n: file: rip/videodvd/base_k3bvideodvdrippingwidget.ui:533
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, m_checkAudioResampling)
#: rc.cpp:243
msgid "Change the sample rate of the audio stream to 44.1 KHz"
msgstr "De Aftastrate vun den Audiostroom to 44,1 kHz ümwanneln"

#. i18n: file: rip/videodvd/base_k3bvideodvdrippingwidget.ui:537
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_checkAudioResampling)
#: rc.cpp:246
msgid ""
"<p>Video DVD audio streams normally are encoded with a sampling rate of "
"48000 Hz. Audio CDs on the other hand are encoded with a sampling rate of "
"44100 Hz.\n"
"<p>If this option is checked K3b will change the sampling rate of the audio "
"stream to 44100 Hz."
msgstr ""
"<p>De Audioströöm vun Video-DVDs sünd normalerwies mit en Aftastrate vun "
"48.000 Hz kodeert, wielt för Audio-CDs normalerwies en Rate vun 44.100 Hz "
"bruukt warrt.\n"
"<p>Is dit anmaakt, ännert K3b de Aftastrate vun den Audiostroom op 44,1kHz."

#. i18n: file: rip/videodvd/base_k3bvideodvdrippingwidget.ui:544
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_checkLowPriority)
#: rc.cpp:250
msgid "Low s&cheduling priority for the video transcoding process"
msgstr "Siet &Prioriteet för't Ümkoderen vun't Video"

